{
  "title": "EBS Snapshot · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "EBS 볼륨의 특정 시점 데이터를 보관하고 새 볼륨으로 복원합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span> Snapshot</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/#guide-1\">백업에서 복원까지</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/#guide-2\">복구 속도와 보관 관리</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>14 / 62</span></div><h1>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span> Snapshot</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EBS 스냅샷은 <strong>볼륨의 특정 시점 데이터를 복구할 수 있도록 보관하는 백업</strong>입니다. 원본 볼륨을 잃었거나 이전 상태가 필요할 때 스냅샷에서 새 볼륨을 만들 수 있습니다.</p><p>스냅샷은 증분 방식<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>으로 저장 공간을 효율적으로 사용합니다. 복구할 때는 원하는 스냅샷을 선택하면 그 시점의 볼륨을 구성할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"incremental-snapshots\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"application-consistency\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"restore-and-initialization\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"fast-snapshot-restore\"></span><h2>백업에서 복원까지</h2><p>복구할 시점에 스냅샷을 생성합니다. 데이터베이스처럼 여러 쓰기 작업이 연결되는 애플리케이션은 쓰기를 조정하거나 애플리케이션에 맞는 절차를 사용해 일관된 백업을 준비합니다.</p><p>복구 시에는 원하는 AZ에 새 EBS 볼륨을 만들고 EC2에 연결합니다. 다른 리전에 보관하려면 스냅샷 복사를 사용할 수 있으며 암호화 키 권한도 함께 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"snapshot-copy-and-sharing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"snapshot-archive\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"recycle-bin\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"data-lifecycle-manager-and-aws-backup\"></span><h2>복구 속도와 보관 관리</h2><p>스냅샷에서 만든 볼륨은 데이터를 처음 읽을 때 초기화로 인한 지연이 발생할 수 있습니다. 복구 직후 성능이 중요하면 초기화 또는 Fast Snapshot Restore 같은 기능을 검토합니다.</p><p>정기 생성과 만료는 Data Lifecycle Manager나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a>으로 관리할 수 있습니다. 장기 보관과 빠른 복구 요구를 구분해 보존 정책을 정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>스냅샷으로 데이터 복구</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>EBS 볼륨</strong><span>복구할 데이터</span></li><li><strong>스냅샷</strong><span>특정 시점 보관</span></li><li><strong>새 볼륨 생성</strong><span>선택한 AZ에서 복원</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">스냅샷은 백업이고, 실제 사용은 복원한 볼륨을 연결해 시작합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>설정 변경 전에 스냅샷을 생성합니다. 변경 후 문제가 생기면 이전 스냅샷에서 새 볼륨을 만들고 애플리케이션을 복구합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>증분 방식</strong> — 직전 백업 이후 변경된 블록을 중심으로 저장하는 방식입니다. 사용자는 이전 백업들을 직접 조합하지 않고 선택한 복구 시점을 사용할 수 있습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ebs/latest/userguide/ebs-snapshots.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon EBS snapshots ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q044/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q044\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q044\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q044</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q044/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can an EBS volume in AZ A be attached directly to an EC2 instance in AZ B?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q044\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The volume and instance must be in the same AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q044\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Both AZs are in the same Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q044\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the instance has a public IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q044\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if CloudFront is configured</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 볼륨과 연결 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>는 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>여야 한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">스냅샷</a>에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> B에 새 볼륨을 만들 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q100\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q100\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q100</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q100/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application spans multiple AZs, but a proposal requires a server in AZ B to directly mount one EBS volume in AZ A without changes. What is the flaw?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q100\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Backups can be stored only in S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q100\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront is missing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q100\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume must be in the same AZ as the EC2 instance it attaches to</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q100\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 is required</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>를 넘는 공유 파일 접근은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>형 파일 시스템을 고려하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 데이터는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">스냅샷</a> 복원 등으로 이동한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">EBS Snapshot</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q047\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q047\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q047</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q047/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Linux EC2 instances in multiple AZs must share the same files through a POSIX/NFS interface. Which service should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Each instance's local instance store</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q047\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">One EBS volume directly attached across AZs</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 마운트 대상을 통해 여러 Linux 자원에서 공유할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q039\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q039\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q039</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q039/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance needs an operating-system-visible volume for database files. What type of storage is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Block storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Object storage</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DNS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q039\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Publish/subscribe messaging</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 같은 블록 장치가 파일 시스템을 생성해 사용하는 볼륨이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q052\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q052\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q052</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to centrally manage backup schedules and retention policies for EBS and RDS across multiple accounts. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q052\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a>은 지원 리소스의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 계획과 보존을 중앙화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">이전 용어 <b>EBS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">다음 용어 <b>EC2</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
